# Real looking-for-group talk (the talking update). lfg_self: a solo bot looking for a group, with its real
# level and class. lfm: a bot group that is really recruiting ({need} is "a healer", "a tank", "a puller"
# or "dps"; {camp} is where the group is). join: said in /group when the bot joins the player's group.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).

# ---- lfg_self ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@kind lfg
@topic lfg_self
@who *
@needs solo
@invites lfg
lfg {level} {class}, anything
{class} {level} lfg, pst
lfg, {level} {class}, any camp
{level} {class} lf group, got a few hours
lfg {level} {class}, will run to you
{class} lfg, {level}, been waiting a while
{level} {class} lfg, anyone?
lf grp, {level} {class}
lfg {camp}, {level} {class}
{level} {class}, lfg xp group, can start now
lfg, {class} {level}, know my class
{level} {class} lfg, dont care where
{class} {level} lfg, full buffs and potions
lfg any xp, {level} {class}, inv pls
{level} {class} lfg, lets get a group going
lfg {level} {class}, solo xp is killing me
{class} {level} lf anything with xp, pst
@needs solo,xp_high
{level} {class} lfg, so close to a ding
@needs solo
@needs solo,outdoors
{class} {level} lfg {zone} or close
lfg in {zone}, {level} {class}
{level} {class} lfg, already at {zone}
