lfg {level} {class}, can hold aggro
@class Wizard,Theurgist,Sorcerer,Cabalist,Runemaster,Spiritmaster,Eldritch,Enchanter
{level} {class} lfg, nukes ready
lfg {level} {class}, decent dmg, low hp
